980},{"id":"72157680841154804","position":710}],"bytes":5783811,"camera_position":8980,"comments":[],"description":"","detail":"photos/0149.json","filename":"36643214354_052586d8cd_o.jpg","flickr_url":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/earthwandering/36643214354/","height":3214,"id":"36643214354","kind":"photo","license":"All Rights Reserved","original":"originals/36643214354/36643214354_052586d8cd_o.jpg","sha256":"cc79ef71241c3f17234c21609b52831e1b132825ef336362f8615379c66c2660","tags":["lasqueti island","canada","strait of georgia","sailing"],"taken":"2017-06-17 13:34:11","title":"IMG_5706","uploaded":"2017-09-27 07:23:13","width":5128},"36643217534":{"albums":[{"id":"72157643911711523","position":8979},{"id":"72157680841154804","position":709}],"bytes":2516429,"camera_position":8979,"comments":[],"description":"","detail":"photos/0149.json","filename":"36643217534_42e4f93b8b_o.jpg","flickr_url":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/earthwandering/36643217534/","height":2280,"id":"36643217534","kind":"photo","license":"All Rights Reserved","original":"originals/36643217534/36643217534_42e4f93b8b_o.jpg","sha256":"d16199aca4692dbcce0224ba7b1d7f2aed2fa693b373f4577fd3ac39d56be9ee","tags":["lasqueti island","canada","strait of georgia","sailing"],"taken":"2017-06-17 13:23:21","title":"IMG_5704","uploaded":"2017-09-27 07:23:24","width":3156},"36647441396":{"albums":[{"id":"72157643911711523","position":8776},{"id":"72157680841154804","position":506}],"bytes":4170307,"camera_position":8776,"comments":[{"author":"89119745@N00","date":"2017-08-22 15:04:42","text":"Love the old Cals. Raced them for years here in Detroit."},{"author":"100330886@N04","date":"2017-08-24 11:52:02","text":"[https://www.flickr.com/photos/89119745@N00] Nice!  It's funny that I didn't associate Detroit with sailboats until reading the Atom Voyages blog.  Have you heard of James Baldwin from Atom Voyages (not the famous author), his stories of sailing around the world started in Detroit if I remember correctly: atomvoyages.com/us.html"},{"author":"89119745@N00","date":"2017-08-27 12:04:47","text":"[http://www.flickr.com/photos/100330886@N04/]  No, I haven't heard of him. The blog looks interesting...I'll check it out in depth later.\nThe 2017 Cal 25 Nationals just took place about a mile from my home, and had entries from MI, MD, FL, and CA for sure. More states may have been represented. Those old pocket cruisers are a big deal around here!"},{"author":"100330886@N04","date":"2017-08-28 09:53:19","text":"Nice!  They sure are a good size to get into sailing, while still making it possible to actually cruise distances."}],"description":"","detail":"photos/0149.json","filename":"36647441396_d889944485_o.jpg","flickr_url":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/earthwandering/36647441396/","height":2254,"id":"36647441396","kind":"photo","license":"All Rights Reserved","original":"originals/36647441396/36647441396_d889944485_o.jpg","sha256":"f866e1abb0c37e3f81190ed923548b87af0232449fae2cf196e5f5ecab60dfdf","tags":["sailing","Vancouver","vancouver bc","canada","false creek"],"taken":"2017-05-31 11:19:17","title":"IMG_4703","uploaded":"2017-08-20 09:47:53","width":5290},"36647489126":{"albums":[{"id":"72157643911711523","position":8774},{"id":"72157680841154804","position":504}],"bytes":3757342,"camera_position":8774,"comments":[],"description":"","detail":"photos/0149.json","filename":"36647489126_440831df05_o.jpg","flickr_url":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/earthwandering/36647489126/","height":2356,"id":"36647489126","kind":"photo","license":"All Rights Reserved","original":"originals/36647489126/36647489126_440831df05_o.jpg","sha256":"8b2e33d8a2cab85dccf0dd4c7e8c1d4be32fd89906f2bdbc7efe98670d3c4514","tags":["sailing","Vancouver","vancouver bc","canada","false creek"],"taken":"2017-05-30 22:40:43","title":"IMG_4698","uploaded":"2017-08-20 09:49:36","width":4946},"36647515466":{"albums":[{"id":"72157643911711523","position":8773},{"id":"72157680841154804","position":503}],"bytes":537